    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Moves a character&apos;s mouth with its voice. Plays the server&apos;s viseme track (the speaking GenerateAndSpeak node needs emit_visemes on) on a face with ARKit morph targets, in step with the audio the Tryll Speaker is playing.</para>
<para>Only the morph targets its pose table names are written; everything else on the mesh (blinks, brows, expressions) is left to the character&apos;s animation. Written morph targets override the AnimBP&apos;s value for that name while non-zero, and return to it at rest.</para>
<para>Requires a <ref refid="class_u_tryll_speaker_component" kindref="compound">UTryllSpeakerComponent</ref>: it is the audio, the playback clock and the source of the viseme track. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
